2026-06-26 04:34:57,859 | AGENT | TechnicalArchitect Agent answered: The proposed technical architecture for the intelligent assistance tool is based on our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with existing hospital information systems. 

Our platform includes a document-ingestion pipeline for parsing and metadata extraction, a vector store for efficient information storage, and a retrieval layer with hybrid search capabilities. The orchestration layer routes queries through retrieval, generation, and post-processing, while the answer layer provides grounded responses with source citations and retrieval traces.

