In terms of security and identity management, our platform supports SSO (SAML, OIDC) and user directories (LDAP, Entra ID), ensuring secure access to the intelligent assistance tool from the hospital staff's work environment. With a focus on data protection and compliance with regulatory requirements like GDPR, our solution guarantees the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of sensitive health data.

By leveraging our Atelier platform and hosting it on a sovereign cloud infrastructure within the European Union, we can provide a highly available, responsive, and secure intelligent assistance tool that meets the client's technical requirements and constraints while ensuring continuity of care and compliance with regulatory standards.
